        "body": "**CSS** (Cascading Style Sheets) styles your HTML. A rule has a **selector** (what to style) and a **declaration block** of `property: value;` pairs. Example: `p { color: blue; }` makes all paragraphs blue. CSS controls color, spacing, layout, and more.",
